<!-- Post title -->
<h3 class="storytitle" id="post-12"><a href="http://www.marksportal.net/blog/index.php?p=12" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Signs">Signs</a></h3>


		
		<!-- Actual post -->
<div class="storycontent">
	<p>There&#8217;s something I&#8217;ve been meaning/wanting to do for a bit, but I just haven&#8217;t done it yet.  I bare no shame in saying I&#8217;m scared to do it.  Heck, everyone is scared of doing something whether it be small or great.  However, lately I&#8217;ve been noticing things pointing to this thing I&#8217;m scared of doing.   So I have to question:  Are these really &#8220;signs&#8221; I&#8217;m seeing or is it just my mind linking these events to the thing I&#8217;m scared of doing.  I know there are some people out there who don&#8217;t mind taking risks.  Who like to take on their fears head on.   I&#8217;m not one of those people.   As my father once said, &#8220;Mark, you are the type of person who would carefully approach something, watch other people do it, and then if it looks ok, you&#8217;ll try it yourself.&#8221;    I didn&#8217;t realize that about myself until he said that.   That is indeed who I am.   That&#8217;s not to say that I never take a chance, everyone has to in life whether they want to or not.   However, I do avoid it the best I can.   And that&#8217;s all I have to say about that&#8230;.right now.
</p>
